  "changes": [
    "Visible Settings label plus direct Models & Providers API-key file import, visible import results and refreshed provider/model UI.",
    "Five plugin cards show saved/missing token state separately from enabled state; dedicated source-specific personal-token help, masked editing and explicit encrypted Save/Remove.",
    "Read-only saved-token checks use fixed GitHub/Supabase/Figma/Vercel/PostHog endpoints, bounded requests, manual redirects and safe local result messages. PostHog US/EU is explicit; scopes/errors are distinguished.",
    "Plugin saves/removals use revision-checked ProviderRepository; corrupt/concurrent stores are preserved, stale connection results are ignored, callback deletion/reentry is guarded.",
    "Actual worker integration fixtures run pinned skill snippets for all5 services through encrypted storage, PluginCatalog, AgentToolHost, QuickJS and NetworkBroker; production origin registry is unchanged.",
    "NetworkBroker supports a host-only borrowed transport for deterministic tests, with destruction/cancellation handling; default transport remains native QNetworkAccessManager.",
    "Archive family iteration no longer references a destroyed temporary; busy file mutation state is rechecked after agent-stop callbacks. Two before failures now pass."
  ],
  "connectionEndpoints": {
    "github": {
