  },
  "limits": [
    "New automated plugin/service tests use synthetic credentials and transport responses plus loopback model streams; no real keys or live service requests were used.",
    "A connection check verifies only its read endpoint. Service permissions, TLS/DNS, all remote mutations and actual user account entitlements are not established.",
    "No close failure reproduced in the previous ready artifact; that was not the older preview reported by the user. Both controls are checked again in the new packaged artifact.",
    "Provider/model reasoning is nondeterministic and not claimed identical. OAuth/install ecosystem and other full-parity gaps remain recorded in README/reference-readiness.",
    "Runtime requires installed WebView2 Evergreen, Git and PowerShell. There is no Node/Electron sidecar; no clean-machine provisioning test is claimed."
  ],
